Second pass on `src/blog/people/drafts/Penguinz0.md` is done. Source audit went from 0 inline / 4 vague / 1 untagged to **7/7 inline, 0 untagged**, and blog-lint is at **0 fail** (the one warn is the not-yet-run frontmatter-enrich stage).

**What changed:**

