- **Caught a factual error the fresh-eyes review missed:** the cold-open kicker ("There are so many better options for your money…") was staged as the post-earnings-reveal mic drop, but it's from the October 9 video — Video Games Chronicle put it in a headline on October 10, before the earnings video existed. The cold open is restructured so the drama no longer depends on the wrong timeline.
