- **Trims:** calm-epithet stack cut from six variants to three, the diagnosis section's shutdown re-narration compressed to a clause, the shirt/desk/city motif reduced to three instances, and the Rabbit Hole's vague "a band, a graphic novel" cashed out as The Gentle Men and GODSLAP (fresh-eyes had the band name wrong — "The Little Cars" isn't his).

